es": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["可选提示。您可以将其留空，让模型“猜测”顶部和底部应该涂黑哪些部分。\n\n或者，您可以描述您希望在涂黑区域看到的内容。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [389.6229248046875, 88.85089111328125], "pos": [458.584716796875, -799.9406127929688], "id": 193, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["源帧数将显示源视频的长度（遗憾的是，仅在开始生成后才会显示）。\n\n输入目标视频的帧数长度。您可以估算一下。\n\n您也可以输入比源视频更长的时长。这样视频实际上会稍微延长一些（然后淡入一个灰色方块）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [469.5177917480469, 104.73616790771484], "pos": [414.3880615234375, -528.5980834960938], "id": 192, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [210, 100], "pos": [430.3807678222656, -661.9266967773438], "widgets_values": ["raw value", "160.96"], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 297, "label": "输入", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模式"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 198, "type": "DisplayAny", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_essentials", "ver": "9d9f4bedfc9f0321c19faf71855e228c93bd0dc9", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"mode": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DisplayAny"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["  \n--------\n\n## 说明:  \n**我会保留原有的笔记，但我不知道他们为什么选择Causvid T2V Lora。\n这是一个奇怪的选择，因为这不是 T2V 工作流程。\n我添加了 I2V FusionX Lora，它与此配合使用效果更好。**  \nLora:  \nhttps://huggingface.co/vrgamedevgirl84/Wan14BT2VFusioniX/resolve/main/FusionX_LoRa/Wan2.1_I2V_14B_FusionX_LoRA.safetensors\n\n\n  \n--------\n\n原始说明:\n\n[Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/vace) | [教程](https://docs.comfy.org/zh-CN/tutorials/video/wan/vace)\n\n[Causvid Lora extracted  by Kijai](https://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1knuafk/causvid_lora_massive_speedup_for_wan21_made_by/) Thanks to CausVid MIT\n\n##  14B 支持 480P 720P\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n供参考：使用 RTX 4090 显卡测试该工作流程时，在 720P 分辨率下以 81 帧/秒的帧率运行完整程序大约需要 40 分钟。\n使用 Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors 后，可能只需 4 分钟左右即可完成。 \n\n## 1.3B Support 480P only\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n供参考：使用Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors后，可能只需要大约 2 分钟。\n## Other Models\n\n* 如果您之前使用过 Wan 工作流程，则可能已经拥有这些模型。\n\n**VAE**\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors?download=true)\n\n**Text encoders**   Chose one of following model\n- [umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors?download=true)\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true)\n\n> 你可以选择 fp16 或 fp8；我使用fp16是为了与Kijai的封装器兼容。\n\n文件保存路径\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   ├── diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├-── wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └─── wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors \n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors # or fp16\n│   ├── loras/\n│   │   ├── Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   │   └── Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └──  wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n```\n  \n## 关于 CausVid Lora\n\n我们已默认启用CausVid LoRA以实现加速效果。但某些情况下视频可能出现抖动或模糊现象。建议您尝试不同强度的LoRA参数以获得最佳效果，参数值应在0.3至0.7之间。如无需此功能，可使用旁路模式禁用，并将`KSampler`设置恢复为默认配置。\n\n## 关于模型选择 \n\n14B模型的生成质量更高，但生成耗时更长。若已下载模型，可选择直接使用上方节点，或仅修改加载器节点加载的模型。\n对应的LoRA应与扩散模型匹配。例如，14B扩散模型对应的LoRA即为14B LoRA。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [481.9181823730469, 1133.7659912109375], "pos": [-737.1646118164062, 70.92520141601562], "id": 183, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.26.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "node_versions": {"comfy-core": "0.3.34"}, "ds": {"offset": [1709.4908433000264, 196.00843045787155], "scale": 0.5989500000000026}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Sampling & Decoding", "bounding": [702.1438598632812, 39.95917892456055, 720, 620]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "Load Video for Outpainting", "bounding": [-169.4110107421875, 685.2928466796875, 580, 410]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "